{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"主线逐渐偏向是否回到旧日关系、能否重新获得陪伴，以及未来独自面对困难时能否撑住。对归属的怀念因此部分转化成了对孤独和缺少支持的顾虑。\",\n    \"维持尊严的行动主要体现为当初决定离开、不愿重新忍受委屈，以及最后不为陪伴而回头；它更多是怀念与回归之间的限制条件，没有像 Center 所要求的那样持续与怀念相互牵动、共同变化。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"维持尊严的行动有时较抽象，主要表现为自持、稳住自己、守住分寸和体面，具体行动及其代价呈现得不够充分。\",\n    \"部分段落着重描写无措、惊惧、疲惫等情绪起伏，与尊严和归属之间的相互作用不够清晰，偶尔显得像独立的情绪线。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y 更完整地保留了尊严与旧日归属这两个核心要素，而且两者反复相互影响：怀念动摇自持，自持又限制对旧日的追寻，最后形成带着牵挂继续守住体面的选择。X 虽然也包含两者，但叙事重心逐渐转向回不回去以及如何应对孤独，因而更接近 Center 的一个具体侧面。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d984ba7d-784d-428e-a3c8-2714c4f4109c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T080636217517Z", "elapsed_seconds": 11.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:06:48.060543+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5402b888e90d9bcabd3a190747a5790e947f10d55b4f71fdf3ff7958095d1b80", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3e